          <change when="2023-04-04T07:21:40-04:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/james.cowey">General - Perhaps ϛ&lt;#((ὀβολὸς))=1#&gt; &lt;#((ἡμιωβέλιον))=1/2#&gt; is what should be here cf. lin4 and 5. Cf. O.Bodl. 2 905 or 907 where the signature (would be missing here) is followed by a statement of the amount paid (second repetition of amount paid in each case)</change>
